{"id":"punkt","lemma":"Punkt","pos":"noun","rank":779,"glosses":["dot (marking an abbreviation)","full stop, period (indicating end of sentence)","point"],"ipa":"/pʊŋ(k)t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f2/De-Punkt.ogg/De-Punkt.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Punktes","plural":"Punkte"},"examples":[{"text":"Das ist der Punkt.","en":"That's the point.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394594","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Komm Punkt sechs Uhr hierher.","en":"Come here at precisely six o'clock.","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},null,{"g":"six (numerical value…"},{"g":"hours, o'clock"},{"g":"to here, here , hither"}]},{"text":"Wie viele Punkte hast du bekommen?","en":"How many points did you get?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to receive"}]},{"text":"Könntest du direkt zum Punkt kommen?","en":"Can you get straight to the point?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"directly"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"to come"}]},{"text":"In diesem Punkte stimme ich dir zu.","en":"I agree with you on this point.","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"voice"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"to / too"}]}]}